[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16980.51, "timestamp": "04:43:00", "text": "所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16984.23, "timestamp": "04:43:04", "text": "就像我喜欢的那样，即使有人会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16986.948, "timestamp": "04:43:06", "text": "假设我们曾经很亲密，但并不亲近。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16990.55, "timestamp": "04:43:10", "text": "我们之间确实有某种联系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16993.03, "timestamp": "04:43:13", "text": "是的，这又是准社会行为，但仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16996.628, "timestamp": "04:43:16", "text": "就像，嗯，不，就像他们认识你，你不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16999.948, "timestamp": "04:43:19", "text": "对他们来说完全是个陌生人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17002.708, "timestamp": "04:43:22", "text": "东西。你已经完成了一些活动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17005.83, "timestamp": "04:43:25", "text": "一起活动等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17009.27, "timestamp": "04:43:29", "text": "不管是不是像声音那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17012.15, "timestamp": "04:43:32", "text": "说话方式像直接说话一样，但又像在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17014.708, "timestamp": "04:43:34", "text": "VC 或者像游戏 VC 之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17016.948, "timestamp": "04:43:36", "text": "再玩一遍，把那些东西都放进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17021.19, "timestamp": "04:43:41", "text": "呃，但是，是的，当我走近时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17022.43, "timestamp": "04:43:42", "text": "就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17024.27, "timestamp": "04:43:44", "text": "聚会或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17027.75, "timestamp": "04:43:47", "text": "某种合作，我也不知道为什么，也许吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17030.948, "timestamp": "04:43:50", "text": "因为他们是她，就像更高的数字"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17031.788, "timestamp": "04:43:51", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17034.47, "timestamp": "04:43:54", "text": "就像太严肃了之类的，我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17037.99, "timestamp": "04:43:57", "text": "我知道，但是，是的，他们感觉就像……"}]